  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Growth Research Team&#x2019;s financial contribution to the World Bank for impact evaluations, research capacity building and engaging policy-makers on effective policies on girls and women&#x2019;s economic empowerment in sub-Saharan Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Growth Research Team&#x2019;s financial contribution to the World Bank for impact evaluations, research capacity building and engaging policy-makers on effective policies on girls and women&#x2019;s economic empowerment in sub-Saharan Africa is a component of Jobs and Incomes for Women Research Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;5,847,936. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
